# Anchored with a leading slash, because these exist only at the repository root and a bare
# pattern matches a directory of that name at *any* depth. `media/` silently swallowed
# packages/core/src/media and apps/api/src/media, which built locally and failed in CI. The
# entries below are build output whose names nobody would give a source directory.
/media/
/backups/
coverage/
test-results/
playwright-report/
blob-report/
.DS_Store
spikes/**/out/
